# CVE-2026-14257 - brace-expansion: DoS via inefficient pattern expansion.
#
# Affects: frontend/package-lock.json
#   node_modules/glob/node_modules/brace-expansion          2.1.3
#   node_modules/editorconfig/node_modules/brace-expansion  2.1.3
#
# Why it is not fixed:
#   2.1.3 is the newest 2.x release and is still affected. minimatch@9.0.9
#   requires 2.x and would fail on 5.0.8.
#
# Why the risk is accepted:
#   Dev-only. All brace-expansion instances are marked dev=true.
#
# How to remove this entry:
#   Once @vue/test-utils drops js-beautify@1.x, or glob/editorconfig resolve to
#   versions using minimatch@^10 (which is compatible with brace-expansion 5.x),
#   drop this line and re-run the scan.
CVE-2026-14257
